### 6. Privacy and Security

Licensor warrants that the Software does not require an internet connection for its core operation. Personal data, voice transcripts (if applicable to your hardware setup), and configuration files (including `secrets.yaml`) are processed locally and are never transmitted to Licensor or any third party.

