Licensor may terminate this Agreement if Licensee materially breaches its terms. Because the Software is designed for offline use, "termination" primarily refers to the revocation of the right to receive future updates and support. In the event of a breach involving illegal redistribution, Licensee must cease all use and destroy all copies of the Software.

